   English (default) strings for Hermes Agent.

   Adding a third locale is "add one file": copy this file to
   values-<code>/strings.xml (e.g. values-ja, values-ar) and translate the
   values. No code changes required — every user-facing string is referenced by
   id from Kotlin/Compose, never hardcoded. RTL locales work automatically
   because the UI uses layout-direction-aware start/end modifiers.
-->
